flowchart TD
  start[review start<br/>question, databases,<br/>inclusion and exclusion criteria] --> protocol[protocol.json<br/>write-once]
  protocol --> add[add records<br/>DOI, PMID, arXiv,<br/>normalized title and year]
  add --> screen1[Title / abstract screen]
  screen1 -->|include| screen2[Full-text screen]
  screen1 -->|exclude or maybe<br/>with reason| excluded[Excluded or pending]
  screen2 -->|include| evidence[Evidence<br/>claim + verbatim quote + location]
  screen2 -->|exclude with reason| excluded
  evidence --> status[review status<br/>PRISMA-style counts<br/>exclusion reasons]
  status --> export[export<br/>Markdown, CSV, or JSON]

  add -. every event appended .-> log[(.dsh/review/slug/<br/>event logs)]
  screen1 -.-> log
  screen2 -.-> log
  evidence -.-> log

  classDef step fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
  classDef store fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f97316,color:#7c2d12
  class start,add,screen1,screen2,evidence,status,export step
  class protocol,log,excluded store
